{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Read",
      "Write",
      "Edit",
      "Grep",
      "Glob",
      "Bash(node build/*)",
      "Bash(npm run *)",
      "Bash(npm install)",
      "Bash(npm ci)",
      "Bash(jq *)",
      "Bash(git add *)",
      "Bash(git commit *)",
      "Bash(git switch *)",
      "Bash(git checkout *)",
      "Bash(git status *)",
      "Bash(git diff *)",
      "Bash(git log *)",
      "Bash(git push *)",
      "Bash(git fetch *)",
      "Bash(git branch *)",
      "Bash(git worktree *)",
      "Bash(git rev-parse *)",
      "Bash(git merge-base *)",
      "Bash(git submodule *)",
      "Bash(gh issue create *)",
      "Bash(gh issue edit *)",
      "Bash(gh issue view *)",
      "Bash(gh issue comment *)",
      "Bash(gh issue close *)",
      "Bash(gh issue list *)",
      "Bash(gh label create *)",
      "Bash(gh pr create *)",
      "Bash(gh pr view *)",
      "Bash(gh pr list *)",
      "Bash(gh pr edit *)",
      "Bash(cat *)",
      "Bash(ls *)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(rm *)",
      "Bash(git push --force *)",
      "Bash(git reset --hard *)",
      "Bash(gh repo delete *)",
      "Bash(gh pr merge --admin *)",
      "Bash(gh api -X DELETE *)",
      "Bash(gh api --method DELETE *)"
    ],
    "defaultMode": "acceptEdits"
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "lsg@live-style-guide-loop": true,
    "outsystems@outsystems": true
  },
  "$comment": [
    "The allow-list lets an unattended run work without --dangerously-skip-permissions; the",
    "deny-list is a backstop (patterns match the start of a command only).",
    "",
    "`gh pr merge` is deliberately absent: merging is the human's approval, so it always prompts.",
    "",
    "Skills, the maker/checker agents and the build-before-commit hook come from the lsg plugin:",
    "  /plugin marketplace add kharloridado/live-style-guide-loop",
    "  /plugin install lsg@live-style-guide-loop --scope project"
  ],
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "live-style-guide-loop": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "kharloridado/live-style-guide-loop"
      }
    },
    "outsystems": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "OutSystems/outsystems-mcp"
      }
    }
  }
}
